      "text": "Briefing note explaining you just arrived, engineer was replaced, blueprint of the station\nEngineer is working with rich corporations to sabotage the space station so that it is dismantled and a new one is constructed by them. (that’s why he locked his bag). Discover he is actually not Canadian and was not expecting to be the backup. He had to poison the 1st choice. He was helped by a higher government employee to hide his tracks. Real name is linked to a corporation name. \nOne puzzle is to find the corporations involved\nOne puzzle is to restore internal communication: build a QR code that links to a website page. \nYou have now limited communication with the crew. \n\nFinal clue opens the compartment for the specialized tool to repair the station.\nThis special tool, opens the panel that contains the evidence needed to incriminate the corporations (that’s why it was to well protected)\nYou have to juggle between repairing the station/opening the bag/finding clues",
